{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/compare/master...1e9984772b6ef878d3ae4a58e01d6a6d63a61bd7","html_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/compare/master...1e9984772b6ef878d3ae4a58e01d6a6d63a61bd7","permalink_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/compare/FFmpeg:8f3cccb...FFmpeg:1e99847","diff_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/compare/master...1e9984772b6ef878d3ae4a58e01d6a6d63a61bd7.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/compare/master...1e9984772b6ef878d3ae4a58e01d6a6d63a61bd7.patch","base_commit":{"sha":"8f3cccbca4a5f1f81ab7b990ce1acc4cb7b91abc","node_id":"C_kwDOABiiStoAKDhmM2NjY2JjYTRhNWYxZjgxYWI3Yjk5MGNlMWFjYzRjYjdiOTFhYmM","commit":{"author":{"name":"Romain Beauxis","email":"romain.beauxis@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-21T15:24:32Z"},"committer":{"name":"James Almer","email":"jamrial@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-21T23:30:36Z"},"message":"avcodec/opus/parser: report the duration in units of the sample rate\n\nThe parser duration is documented in units of AVCodecContext.sample_rate,\nbut the Opus parser reported it at 48 kHz whatever the rate. A demuxer\ndeclaring another rate then gave packets a wrong duration.","tree":{"sha":"3b3506c0d9fdbd8cc4ff0fb34068b5beadf4573e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/git/trees/3b3506c0d9fdbd8cc4ff0fb34068b5beadf4573e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/git/commits/8f3cccbca4a5f1f81ab7b990ce1acc4cb7b91abc","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commits/8f3cccbca4a5f1f81ab7b990ce1acc4cb7b91abc","html_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commit/8f3cccbca4a5f1f81ab7b990ce1acc4cb7b91abc","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commits/8f3cccbca4a5f1f81ab7b990ce1acc4cb7b91abc/comments","author":{"login":"toots","id":871060,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MTA2MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/871060?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/toots","html_url":"https://github.com/toots","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toots/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toots/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toots/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toots/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toots/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toots/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toots/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toots/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toots/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"jamrial","id":2442845,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NDI4NDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2442845?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamrial","html_url":"https://github.com/jamrial","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamrial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamrial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamrial/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamrial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamrial/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamrial/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamrial/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamrial/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamrial/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"24c2676ea52dfcb755b04960ca3a9de1bee24d6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commits/24c2676ea52dfcb755b04960ca3a9de1bee24d6b","html_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commit/24c2676ea52dfcb755b04960ca3a9de1bee24d6b"}]},"merge_base_commit":{"sha":"1e9984772b6ef878d3ae4a58e01d6a6d63a61bd7","node_id":"C_kwDOABiiStoAKDFlOTk4NDc3MmI2ZWY4NzhkM2FlNGE1OGUwMWQ2YTZkNjNhNjFiZDc","commit":{"author":{"name":"David Korczynski","email":"david@adalogics.com","date":"2026-05-21T12:56:17Z"},"committer":{"name":"michaelni","email":"michael@niedermayer.cc","date":"2026-06-06T21:32:08Z"},"message":"avcodec/fastaudio: reject subframes count whose * 256 product overflows 32-bit\n\nfastaudio_decode() computes\n    subframes = pkt->size / (40 * channels);\n    frame->nb_samples = subframes * 256;\nboth as 32-bit signed multiplications. When pkt->size is large enough\nto make subframes >= 2^24, the second multiplication overflows the\nsigned int range and frame->nb_samples wraps to a small value.\nff_get_buffer() then sizes the audio plane for that wrapped sample\ncount, while the decoder loop at line 152 still iterates the full\n(unwrapped) subframes count, performing a 1024-byte memcpy per\nsubframe per channel. The 27th iteration (or first iteration with\nnb_samples=0) writes one byte past the per-plane allocation,\nyielding the ASan heap-buffer-overflow WRITE at libavcodec/fastaudio\n.c:171 reported as ANT-2026-03891.\n\nReject the subframes value whose *256 product would overflow before\nperforming the multiplication. The bound INT_MAX / 256 (= 8388607)\nkeeps the existing two's-complement semantics of every reachable\ninput and rejects only the configurations that would have wrapped.\n\nReproducer: a crafted AVI declaring one mono audio chunk of\n671_088_680 bytes (sparse) with the decoder forced via\n'ffmpeg -c:a fastaudio -i evil.avi'.\n\nFound-by: Anthropic agents; validated and reported by Ada Logics.\n\nSigned-off-by: David Korczynski <david@adalogics.com>\nSigned-off-by: Michael Niedermayer <michael@niedermayer.cc>","tree":{"sha":"1a572304a63e8af600dd678d6dd64f66eec275b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/git/trees/1a572304a63e8af600dd678d6dd64f66eec275b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/git/commits/1e9984772b6ef878d3ae4a58e01d6a6d63a61bd7","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commits/1e9984772b6ef878d3ae4a58e01d6a6d63a61bd7","html_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commit/1e9984772b6ef878d3ae4a58e01d6a6d63a61bd7","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commits/1e9984772b6ef878d3ae4a58e01d6a6d63a61bd7/comments","author":{"login":"DavidKorczynski","id":657617,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzYxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/657617?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidKorczynski","html_url":"https://github.com/DavidKorczynski","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidKorczynski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidKorczynski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidKorczynski/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidKorczynski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidKorczynski/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidKorczynski/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidKorczynski/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidKorczynski/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidKorczynski/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"michaelni","id":729390,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyOTM5MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/729390?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelni","html_url":"https://github.com/michaelni","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelni/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.c